# Note9-SD845-Bootchain — local ignore rules
# Binary/proprietary payloads and derived analysis artifacts stay local.
# Only methodology, scripts, manifests (digests), and symbol/offset claims are public.

# Firmware payloads (Odin/MD5, AP tar, raw/extracted components) — NEVER commit.
# Digests of these go to committed analysis/manifest/*.json instead.
firmware/
*.tar
*.tar.md5
*.md5
*.bin
*.mbn
*.elf
*.img
*.lz4

# Local virtualenv for analysis extras (docs/05-environment.md)
.venv/

# Ghidra project files / analysis artifacts
*.gpr
*.rep
*.prp
analysis/export/*.json
analysis/modules/*.md
!analysis/export/.gitkeep
!analysis/modules/.gitkeep

# Findings/triage scratch
findings/